    "detailed_description": "Run and jump around as Doodleguy and draw helpful platforms as the Pencil as you escape from the Big Eraser destroying the world!<br>...and when you're done with that, try making your own fun, or check out what other players have made!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENDLESSLY CUSTOMIZABLE</h2>Want a new challenge? Try drawing some Obstacles!<br><br>Doodleguy looking a bit bald? Draw a Hat to warm his sketchy head!<br>Wanna run faster? Tired of the Pencil? Feeling a different scroll direction? Use Game Modifiers to change up the rules!<br>Tired of your boring old notebook? Create or download a Theme for some new scenery! ...or maybe even a new Doodleguy?<br><br>...and mix all of it together with Collections! Run through an endless forest, or create a scalable cliffside with countless permutations... anything you can draw, you can play!<br>Run through Collections made by other players and go for the High Score!<br><br>Customization lies at the very core of <i>Run, Doodleguy!</i>, so let your endless creativity run wild!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618580/extras/6cb8e6906f8300396f839e6c20c01241.avif?t=1669006029\" /></div>",
